{"schema_version": "1.1", "id": "zhengdao_ge_stanza_01", "type": "stanza", "parent_id": "zhengdao_ge", "order": 1, "lifecycle_status": "active", "superseded_by": null, "w1_status": {"code": "collated_to_claimed_witness", "label": "Collated to claimed witness", "explanation": "Every content field EXACT in T51n2076 (or T48n2005 equivalent), 6/6 content fields collated, evidence sessions/COLLATION_REGISTER_2026-09-21_ENTHUSIAST_100PCT.json", "evidence_path": "sessions/COLLATION_REGISTER_2026-09-21_ENTHUSIAST_100PCT.json", "coverage_note": "6/6 stanzas represented, carrying 6 evaluated source-content fields; W1 source-review status: collated_to_claimed_witness — 6 of 6 source-content fields are verbatim in the claimed witness T48n2014, so the text itself has no recension or re-key problem to disclose. The document's one flagged field is metadata, and it is recorded here: the root title_zh 永嘉真覺大師 證道歌 is a project heading (the master's name prefixed to the title), while the title the witness attests is 永嘉證道歌. Title metadata sits outside the content denominator — it stays project composition, and no Chinese was re-keyed."}, "completion_status": "excerpt_seed", "provenance": {"source_key": "zhengdao-ge", "source_edition": "T51n2076", "cbeta_id": "T2014", "witness_path": "T51n2076.xml", "extraction_rule": "cbeta-p5-body-cjk-v1", "witness_revision": "dbdea41071e1e260ad84b72faefd4587333cf76d", "is_ai_styled": false, "import_reference": {"commit": "dea0c2685ff479af1927ce516919380610d8c9d6", "timestamp": "2026-09-21T15:03:55Z", "evidence_register_path": "sessions/COLLATION_REGISTER_2026-09-21_ENTHUSIAST_100PCT.json", "w1_report_path": "sessions/COLLATION_W1_2026-09-21_ENTHUSIAST_100PCT.md"}}, "texts": [{"lang": "zh-Hant", "script": "Hant", "body": "君不見：絕學無為閒道人，不除妄想不求真。無明實性即佛性，幻化空身即法身。", "is_ai_styled": false}, {"lang": "zh-Latn", "script": "Latn", "transliteration_scheme": "Hanyu Pinyin", "body": "Jūn bù jiàn: Juéxué wúwéi xián dàorén, bù chú wàngxiǎng bù qiú zhēn. Wúmíng shíxìng jí fóxìng, huànhuà kōng shēn jí fǎshēn.", "is_ai_styled": false}, {"lang": "en", "script": "Latn", "body": "Have you not seen the person of the Way who has ceased study and is at ease in non-doing? They do not banish delusion, nor do they seek the truth. The real nature of ignorance is itself the Buddha-nature; this empty illusory phantom body is itself the Dharma body.", "is_ai_styled": true}], "body_format": "plain_cjk_markdown_subset_v1", "canonical_locator": {"source_id": "jingde-chuandenglu", "reference": "T51n2076_pXXXX", "lb_range": "T51n2076_p0001a01–p0001a10"}, "rights_status": "public_domain_candidate", "visibility": "public"}
{"schema_version": "1.1", "id": "congronglu_case_001", "type": "case", "parent_id": "congronglu", "order": 1, "lifecycle_status": "active", "superseded_by": null, "w1_status": {"code": "collated_to_claimed_witness", "label": "Collated to claimed witness", "explanation": "500/500 EXACT in T48n2004, 100 cases collated, evidence sessions/COLLATION_REGISTER_2026-09-21_ENTHUSIAST_100PCT.json", "evidence_path": "sessions/COLLATION_REGISTER_2026-09-21_ENTHUSIAST_100PCT.json"}, "completion_status": "partial_selected_witness", "provenance": {"source_key": "congronglu", "source_edition": "T48n2004", "cbeta_id": "T2004", "witness_path": "T48n2004.xml", "extraction_rule": "cbeta-p5-body-cjk-v1", "witness_revision": "dbdea41071e1e260ad84b72faefd4587333cf76d", "is_ai_styled": false, "import_reference": {"commit": "dea0c2685ff479af1927ce516919380610d8c9d6", "timestamp": "2026-09-21T15:03:55Z", "evidence_register_path": "sessions/COLLATION_REGISTER_2026-09-21_ENTHUSIAST_100PCT.json"}}, "texts": [{"lang": "zh-Hant", "script": "Hant", "body": "示眾云。閉門打睡接上上機。顧鑑頻申。曲為中下。那堪上曲木弄鬼眼睛。有箇傍不肯底。出來。也怪伊不得。", "is_ai_styled": false}, {"lang": "en", "script": "Latn", "body": "Case 1: The Emperor Wu asks Bodhidharma...", "is_ai_styled": true}], "body_format": "plain_cjk_markdown_subset_v1", "canonical_locator": {"taisho": "T48n2004 case 1", "page_line": "0227c28", "case_close_line": "0228b06", "source_edition": "CBETA XML P5 T48n2004 (T48 no. 2004 萬松老人評唱天童覺和尚頌古從容庵錄), revision dbdea41071e1e260ad84b72faefd4587333cf76d"}, "rights_status": "public_domain_candidate", "visibility": "public"}
{"schema_version": "1.1", "id": "chuandenglu_full_case_0128", "type": "case", "parent_id": "chuandenglu_full_fascicle_06", "order": 128, "lifecycle_status": "active", "superseded_by": null, "w1_status": {"code": "collated_to_claimed_witness", "label": "Collated to claimed witness", "explanation": "1,274 units 2,549 EXACT in T51n2076, evidence sessions/COLLATION_REGISTER_2026-09-20_CHUANDENGLU_FULL.json", "evidence_path": "sessions/COLLATION_REGISTER_2026-09-20_CHUANDENGLU_FULL.json"}, "completion_status": "partial_selected_witness", "provenance": {"source_key": "jingde-chuandenglu", "source_edition": "T51n2076", "cbeta_id": "T2076", "witness_path": "T51n2076.xml", "extraction_rule": "cbeta-p5-body-cjk-v1", "witness_revision": "dbdea41071e1e260ad84b72faefd4587333cf76d", "is_ai_styled": false, "import_reference": {"commit": "dea0c2685ff479af1927ce516919380610d8c9d6", "timestamp": "2026-09-21T15:03:55Z", "evidence_register_path": "sessions/COLLATION_REGISTER_2026-09-20_CHUANDENGLU_FULL.json"}}, "texts": [{"lang": "zh-Hant", "script": "Hant", "body": "洪州百丈山懷海禪師洪州百丈山懷海禪師者福州長樂人也丱歲離塵三學該練屬大寂闡化南康乃傾心依附與西堂智藏禪師同號入室時二大士為角立焉一夕二士隨侍馬祖翫月次祖曰正恁麼時如何西堂云正好供養師云正好修行祖云經入藏禪歸海馬祖上堂大眾雲集方陞坐良久師乃卷却面前禮拜席祖便下堂師一日詣馬祖法塔祖於禪床角取拂子示之師云只遮箇更別有祖乃放舊處云爾已後將什麼何為人師却取拂子示之祖云只遮箇更別有師以拂子挂安舊處方侍立祖叱之自此雷音將震果檀信請於洪州新吳界住大雄山以居處巖巒峻極故號之百丈既處之未期月玄參之賓四方至即有溈山黃蘗當其首一日師謂眾曰佛法不是小事老僧昔再蒙馬大師一喝直得三日耳聾眼黑黃蘗聞舉不覺吐舌曰某甲不識馬祖要且不見馬祖師云汝已後當嗣馬祖黃蘗云某甲不嗣馬祖曰作麼生曰已後喪我兒孫師曰如是如是一日有僧哭入法堂來師曰作麼曰父母俱喪請師選日師云明日來一時埋却師上堂云併却咽喉脣吻速道將來溈山云某甲不道請和尚道師云不辭與汝道久後喪我兒孫五峯云和尚亦須併却師云無人處斫額望汝雲巖云某甲有道處請和尚舉師云併却咽喉脣吻速道將來雲巖曰師今有也師曰喪我兒孫師謂眾曰我要一人傳語西堂阿誰去得五峯云某甲去師云汝作麼生傳語五峯云待見西", "is_ai_styled": false}, {"lang": "en", "script": "Latn", "body": "Case 128 Fascicle 6 · Biography", "is_ai_styled": true}], "body_format": "plain_cjk_markdown_subset_v1", "canonical_locator": {"taisho": "T51n2076 fascicle 6", "page_line": "0249b26", "case_close_line": "0250c26", "source_edition": "CBETA XML P5 T51n2076 (T51 no. 2076 景德傳燈錄), revision dbdea41071e1e260ad84b72faefd4587333cf76d"}, "rights_status": "public_domain_candidate", "visibility": "public"}
{"schema_version": "1.1", "id": "caoshan_benji_case_001", "type": "case", "parent_id": "caoshan_benji", "order": 1, "lifecycle_status": "active", "superseded_by": null, "w1_status": {"code": "collated_to_claimed_witness", "label": "Collated to claimed witness", "explanation": "84 units 169 EXACT in X79n1557, evidence sessions/COLLATION_REGISTER_2026-09-20_CAOSHAN.json", "evidence_path": "sessions/COLLATION_REGISTER_2026-09-20_CAOSHAN.json"}, "completion_status": "partial_selected_witness", "provenance": {"source_key": "caoshan-benji", "source_edition": "X79n1557", "cbeta_id": "T1987A", "witness_path": "X79n1557.xml", "extraction_rule": "cbeta-p5-body-cjk-v1", "witness_revision": "dbdea41071e1e260ad84b72faefd4587333cf76d", "is_ai_styled": false, "import_reference": {"commit": "dea0c2685ff479af1927ce516919380610d8c9d6", "timestamp": "2026-09-21T15:03:55Z", "evidence_register_path": "sessions/COLLATION_REGISTER_2026-09-20_CAOSHAN.json"}}, "texts": [{"lang": "zh-Hant", "script": "Hant", "body": "曹山大師語錄序曹山大師語錄序本寂禪師之於洞山蓋瀉瓶而已自一去不變異處至住持大法之道則大與餘者別矣唯因真唱使人至真證也唯真也深玄精粹是以難卒見焉世以為平坦無活用雄略嗚呼浮淺之人胡知時世因真偽以致道之否泰哉實不知之故有詖辭夫師之語要在三墮示修治分位異類通凡聖明道之生熟也洞祖所言道合人人合道老不老事體妙者是也苟知之不可瞞只今唯瞞也多矣元文之間有與洞山錄并行焉而此亦不便多眾之遮眼庚辰之秋吉祥之眾衲就予集錄焉刊版欲與洞祖錄并行而以反正時世妄譌也可謂好心冀有好報且來請引語乃敘錄中至要以冠其首但因曹山意見其道範足一發其意云爾維時寶曆十一年辛巳正月穀旦印指月盥香敘", "is_ai_styled": false}, {"lang": "en", "script": "Latn", "body": "Preface · Caoshan's Record", "is_ai_styled": true}], "body_format": "plain_cjk_markdown_subset_v1", "canonical_locator": {"taisho": "T47n1987A (T47 no. 1987A)", "page_line": "0526b27", "case_close_line": "0526c16", "source_edition": "CBETA XML P5 T47n1987A (T47 no. 1987A 撫州曹山元證禪師語錄), revision dbdea41071e1e260ad84b72faefd4587333cf76d"}, "rights_status": "public_domain_candidate", "visibility": "public"}
